#: Console/Backup.class.php:316
#, php-format
msgid ""
"\n"
" Unable to read the file %s. FreePBX restore process run as asterisk user so "
"please ensure that 'asterisk' user has permissions to read the file/"
"directory path. Or move the backup file to the '/home/asterisk' path."
msgstr ""
"\n"
" 無法讀取檔案 %s。FreePBX 還原程序以 asterisk 使用者執行，請確保「asterisk」使用者有權限讀取檔案/目錄路徑。或將備份檔移到「/home/asterisk」路徑。"

