#: views/restore/landing.php:110
#: views/restore/processRestore.php:89
msgid ""
" The backup file contains legacy chan_sip extensions or trunks, which are "
"not compatible with Asterisk 21. You have the option to proceed, in which "
"case these legacy extensions or trunks will be converted to PJSIP. "
"Alternatively, you can cancel the restore process and downgrade the Asterisk "
"version first, then attempt to restore your backup."
msgstr ""
" 此備份檔包含舊版 chan_sip 分機或中繼，這些與 Asterisk 21 不相容。您可以選擇繼續，此時這些舊版分機或中繼將轉換為 PJSIP。或者，您可以取消還原程序並先降級 Asterisk 版本，然後再嘗試還原備份。"

